      "fine_trace_step": 1,
      "description": "First project-side statement that materializes attacker-controlled stream state used by the bug. After `frame_sync_` has already matched the leading `0xff`, this assignment records the second sync/header byte of a candidate frame and admits the parser into `read_frame_`, which immediately seeds CRC bookkeeping from the current bitreader cursor."
    },
    {
      "invariant_id": "I-ROOT-CONSUMED-WORDS-EXCEED-CRC16-OFFSET",
