      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "A-SINK-WORDS32-PAIR-READ-EXECUTES",
      "fine_trace_step": 7,
      "description": "MSan sink. The wrapped `len` and advanced `words` pointer from `crc16_update_block_()` make this CRC loop dereference past `br->buffer`, and the staged sanitizer trace reports `MemorySanitizer: SEGV` on a READ at line 404 in this expression."
    },
